sequenceDiagram
actor Operator
participant Colony as MarsColony
participant Habitat
participant Emergency
participant Responders as Agents
participant Inventory as ResourceInventory
Operator->>Colony: handleOxygenLeak(habitat, loss)
Colony->>Emergency: create OXYGEN_LEAK
Colony->>Habitat: remove initial oxygen loss
Colony->>Responders: find available human and robot responders
alt responders unavailable
  Colony->>Habitat: remove same loss again
  Colony->>Emergency: mark unresolved
else responders available
  Colony->>Inventory: check SPARE_PARTS and BATTERY_POWER
  alt response resources insufficient
    Colony->>Habitat: remove same loss again
    Colony->>Emergency: mark unresolved
  else enough resources
    Colony->>Inventory: consume response resources
    Colony->>Responders: dispatch and release
    Colony->>Habitat: repair leak
    Colony->>Emergency: RESOLVED
  end
end
